# 1. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Build a premium, modern, fully functional e-commerce website and online marketplace inspired by the shopping experience, product organization, usability, and convenience of Jumia Nigeria.

The platform must have its own unique identity, branding, design language, and user experience. Do not copy Jumia's logo, proprietary assets, exact layouts, or branding.

The website must allow customers to:

- Browse products without creating an account.
- Search and discover products.
- Explore product categories.
- View detailed product information.
- Add products to their shopping cart.
- Save products to their wishlist.
- Register or log in.
- Sign in using Google.
- Checkout securely.
- Select available payment methods.
- Track their orders.
- View their order history.
- Manage their account.

The website owner must have complete control over the business through a secure, private, user-friendly administrator dashboard.

The platform must use:

- WordPress
- WooCommerce
- Firebase Authentication
- Google Sign-In
- Paystack
- Flutterwave
- Bank Transfer
- Pay on Delivery

All systems must be properly integrated rather than merely displayed visually.

